{"id": "16-912-2-4", "zh": "Dadha，意为执持。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-912-5-9", "zh": "因为它维持人们的喜悦，所以叫作 dadhi（酪）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-912-10-20", "zh": "dh 变为 h 时，形式是“dahati”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-912-21-27", "zh": "这个女人把这个女人当作祖母看待。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-912-28-34", "zh": "这些男人把这个男人当作祖父看待。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-912-35-37", "zh": "应当使心专注。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-912-38-40", "zh": "使心专注。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-913-2-6", "zh": "Edha，意为增长，也意为获得。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-913-7-8", "zh": "edhati（增长）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-913-9-12", "zh": "edho（燃料），sukhedhito（在安乐中长大的）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-913-13-15", "zh": "在深水中得到立足之处。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-914-2-7", "zh": "这里，**edho** 一词来自 edhati（增长）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-914-8-12", "zh": "火借着它而增长，所以叫作 edho。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-914-13-16", "zh": "也就是柴薪、燃料。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-914-17-24", "zh": "**sukhedhito**：在安乐中长大，意思是在安乐中被养育长大。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-914-25-31", "zh": "**gādhamedhati**：意思是得到（edhati，即 labhati）可以站稳的立足之处。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-915-2-4", "zh": "Baddha，用于 saṃharisa 之义。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-915-5-7", "zh": "saṃharisa 就是捆缚的动作。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-915-8-11", "zh": "baddhati（束缚）、vinibaddhati（紧紧束缚）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-915-12-13", "zh": "vinibaddhā（被缠缚的）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-916-2-4", "zh": "Gādha，用于立足、依止与编结之义。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-916-5-6", "zh": "gādhati（立足）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-916-7-9", "zh": "造出立足之处的人。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-916-10-12", "zh": "因为很深，所以无处立足（agādha）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-917-2-7", "zh": "Bādha，意为扰乱：bādhati（逼恼）、vibādhati（严重逼恼）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-917-8-9", "zh": "ābādho（病）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-917-10-14", "zh": "它逼恼、扰乱人心，所以叫作 ābādha（病）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-918-2-5", "zh": "Nādha，用于乞求等义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-918-6-7", "zh": "nādhati（乞求）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-918-8-9", "zh": "nādhana（乞求）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-919-2-5", "zh": "Bandha，意为捆绑：bandhati（捆绑）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-919-6-25", "zh": "bandhanako（捆绑者）、bandho（被捆绑的）、bandhāpito（被使人捆绑的）、paṭibandho（系属）、bandhanaṃ（绳索）、bandho（束缚）、sambandhanaṃ（连结）、sambandho（关联）、pabandho（相续）、bandhu（亲属）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-920-2-11", "zh": "其中，bandhana：人们用它来捆绑众生，所以叫作 bandhana，也就是锁链之类。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-920-12-33", "zh": "因为应当以“这是我们的家族”而相互联结，所以叫作 bandhu（亲属）；不过《长老偈注释》里说的是“以爱的纽带相系，所以是亲属”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-921-2-4", "zh": "Dadhi，意为行动不快。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-921-5-7", "zh": "行动不快，就是进行得迟缓。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-921-8-9", "zh": "dandhati（迟缓）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-921-10-13", "zh": "dandho（迟钝的），dandhapañño（智慧迟钝的人）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-921-14-21", "zh": "谁在该慢的时候急进，在该急的时候却迟缓。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-922-2-4", "zh": "Vaddha，意为增长。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-922-5-6", "zh": "vaddhati（增长）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-922-7-20", "zh": "vaddhi、vuddhi（增长），vaddho、vuddho（长者），jātivuddho（出身尊贵的长者），guṇavuddho（德行上的长者），vayovuddho（年龄上的长者）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-923-2-8", "zh": "那些尊敬长者、通晓正法的人，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-924-2-9", "zh": "在现世受到称赞，来世也往生善趣。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-925-2-4", "zh": "Sadhu，意为腹中出声，即放屁。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-925-5-6", "zh": "sadhati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-926-2-4", "zh": "Piḷadhi，意为装饰。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-926-5-6", "zh": "piḷandhati（佩戴）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-926-7-8", "zh": "piḷandhana（饰品）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-927-2-6", "zh": "佩饰（piḷandhana）、庄严（alaṅkāra）、装扮（maṇḍana）与装饰（vibhūsana），", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-928-2-7", "zh": "妆饰（pasādhana）与首饰（ābharaṇa），这些都被视为同义词。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-929-2-6", "zh": "Medha，意为伤害，也意为结合。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-929-7-8", "zh": "medhati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-929-9-12", "zh": "medhā（慧），medhāvī（有慧的人）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-929-13-23", "zh": "这里，**medhā**：它像雷电击碎岩山一样摧毁烦恼，所以叫作 medhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-929-24-40", "zh": "或者，它与吉祥以及戒等善人之法同行，不单独存在，所以叫作 medhā，这是慧的名称。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-929-41-43", "zh": "正如所说：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-930-2-10", "zh": "“智者们说，智慧最为殊胜，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-931-2-4", "zh": "如同月亮在群星之中；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-932-2-7", "zh": "戒、吉祥与善人之法，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-933-2-7", "zh": "都追随有智慧的人。”", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-934-2-3", "zh": "这是经中所说的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-934-4-10", "zh": "**medhāvī**：具足法精华之慧（dhammojapaññā）的人。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-935-2-5", "zh": "Sadhu、madhu，意为湿润。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-935-6-7", "zh": "sadhati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-935-8-9", "zh": "madhati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-935-10-11", "zh": "madhu（蜜）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-936-2-4", "zh": "Budha，意为觉知。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-936-5-6", "zh": "bodhati（觉知）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-936-7-8", "zh": "buddho（佛陀，觉者）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-936-9-10", "zh": "abhisambuddhāno（证得正觉的）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-936-11-12", "zh": "sambuddhaṃ（已觉知的）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-936-13-14", "zh": "asambuddhaṃ（未觉知的）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-936-15-16", "zh": "bodhi（菩提）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-936-17-21", "zh": "这个词根在 divādi 类中也可以见到。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-936-22-40", "zh": "在那一类里，形式是“bujjhati”；而在这里，形式是“bodhati”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-936-41-51", "zh": "圣典中可以见到“yo nindaṃ apabodhati（谁能觉察并避开责难）”这句话。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-936-52-60", "zh": "而在使役形式中，则有“bodheti”等。", "confidence": 85}
